 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? Keep the invite list to your close friends and family. Send out the full guest list only a month before the wedding, so people know to plan ahead. That's the one you can't share, right? Invite her to a fitting with the maid of honor, bridesmaids, and couple of groomsmen. Dresses can be expensive, so this is common. It' a nice tradition, but don't pressure yourself. Have the small wedding you want, and keep the honeymoon for yourself. Give her the option of renting wedding gown if she's hurt. It's a lovely gesture.",
